0014: 001B                       fdb   regdmp-*-2 offset to actual code
0016: 80                         fcb   $80        end of table
0017:                   
0017: 318CF9            start    leay  <svctabl,pcr point to service table
001A: 103F32                     os9   F$SSvc     insert the new op code in the table
001D: 86C1                       lda   #tylg      get next module type (same as this one!)
001F: 308D0008                   leax  <nextname,pcr get address of next module name
0023: 103F00                     os9   F$Link     attempt to link to it
0026: 2502                       bcs   endsetup   no good...skip this
0028: ADA4                       jsr   ,y         else go execute it
002A: 39                endsetup rts              return back to previous module
002B:                   
002B: 6B726E7035        nextname fcc   /krnp5/    next module name to link to
0030: 0D                         fcb   C$CR
